#AAPlayerChat

WorldgenReminderInfo1: Hey uh...kid? Correct me if I'm wrong, but I think your world didn't generate with Ancients Awakened stuff in it. I'd make a new one if I were you.
WorldgenReminderInfo2: YOU IMBECILE! YOU DIDN'T GENERATE ANCIENTS AWAKENED CONTENT! MAKE A NEW WORLD NOW! REEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE
WorldgenReminderInfo3: ERR0R. W0RLD D0ES N0T APPEAR T0 C0NTAIN AAM0D.TM0D C0NTENT. PLEASE GENERATE A NEW W0RLD.
WorldgenReminderInfo4: HEY! You didn't generate Ancients Awakened stuff in this world! Generate a new world before I blast you to mars!
WorldgenReminderInfo5: Hey, uh...I don't see any Ancients Awakened content in this world. Might be smart to make a new world or whatever...
WorldgenReminderInfo6: Hey. You. Interdimensional being. You might have forgotten to make a new world after downloading the mod. Make a new world if you want all the mod's content.
WorldgenReminderInfo7: Make...new world....or mushmad...will squish...little terrarian...
WorldgenReminderInfo8: ...Mortal. Your world doesn't have Ancients Awakened content if my old eyes do not deceive me. Generating a new world would be optimal.
WorldgenReminderInfo9: Earthwalker..! There's no Ancients Awakened stuff in this world! Make a new world if you really wanna play this mod...idiot...
NewAAInfo1: Hey kid, did you know there's a newer version of Ancients Awakened you could be playing? Might be worth checking it out if you ask me.
NewAAInfo2: YOU'RE QUITE THE FOOL! YOU PROBABLY DON'T EVEN KNOW THERE'S A NEWER VERSION OF ANCIENTS AWAKENED YOU COULD BE PLAYING!
NewAAInfo3: WARNING. AAM0D.TM0D N0T DETECTED. 0PTIMAL C0NTENT MISSING.
NewAAInfo4: HEY YOU! Don't forget to check out the new version of Ancients Awakened, or else!
NewAAInfo5: Hey, uh... I'm not sure if you knew, but there's a newer version of Ancients Awakened you could be playing. You might wanna give it a try or something...
NewAAInfo6: Interdimensional being. in case you didn't already know, there's a newer version Ancients Awakened you could be playing. Give it a look when you give the chance.
NewAAInfo7: Play new...ancients awakened....or mushmad...will crush...little terrarian...
NewAAInfo8: ...Mortal. I hear tell of a newer version of Ancients Awakened you could be playing. Perhaps it would be wise to try it out.
NewAAInfo9: Earthwalker! You should know that you could be playing a newer version of Ancients Awakened. You'd be an idiot not to give it a try!
