downedSistersInfo: Chaotic energy grows in the deepest parts of the world.
downedBoss2Info: You hear a hum of harmony from the Terrarium after the defeat of a great demon...
downedBoss3Info1: Bones of the ancient past burst with energy!
downedBoss3Info2: The desert winds stir...
downedBoss3Info3: The winter hills rumble...
downedMechBossInfo: Hey kid, it's me, Anubis. Do me a favor and meet me back in town, I wanna talk to ya about somethin'.
downedAllAncientsInfo: Chaos begins to stir in the atmosphere...
hardModeInfo: The Souls of Fury and Wrath are unleashed upon the world!
