#AAConfig

AATownNPCInfo: Disables this mod's town npcs from spawning, for those who'd prefer to have other npcs spawn quicker. Note: This does not affect Anubis due to him being key to progression.
DisableBossDialogue: Disable Boss Dialogue
DisableBossDialogueInfo: Disables dialogue from bosses to prevent chatspam. Also makes animations that have boss dialogue go by a little quicker.
DisableNewAAReminderMessage: Disable Ancients Awakened Reminder Message
DisableNewAAReminderMessageInfo: Disables the reminder message on world join to check out Ancients Awakened [BETA].
